  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\">Anti Ragging Day/Week - 2025</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">As a part of Anti Ragging Day/Week from 13-8-2025 to 18-8-2025! ATMECE has organized the'following Competitions.\n1. Hand Written Poster presentation competition, on Aug-14th 2025, at 11:00 AM to 12.00PM, in the Civil Block.\n2.An online Quiz competition on \"Anti Ragging Act \" for all the students. On 14th August 2025 at 12.00PM,\n* Quiz link was shared through WhatsApp group.\nTotal 10 students were participated in poster presentation competition and 150 students were attended the online quiz competition.</p>\n\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Anti-ragging-day-Events.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]",
